/// The platform's CI on GitHub Actions: checks that the generated files are
/// what the model generates (esquadro gen -check), the playbooks
/// (ansible-lint) and, with cloudflare, the OpenTofu code (tofu validate).
/// It never touches the servers: you apply from your machine. It runs as
/// little as it can, to save Actions minutes: pushes to main and pull
/// requests ready for review, older runs cancelled.
blueprint github_actions {
  version "0.1.0"
  for platform
  requires server
  optional cloudflare
}
